        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-126371-02c8a379627bd8aa",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-126371",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As we considered developing IKT-001 in PAH, we also recognized that the learnings of over 20-years of oncology clinical experience with imatinib, together with changes in the standard of care for these patients, may have alleviated much of the safety risk previously observed for imatinib in PAH patients.",
