        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Four of the six trademark applications that we filed for (INHIBIKASE (two applications) and IKT (and Design)) have issued to registration, and the fourth and fifth applications (a third application for INHIBIKASE and a second application for IKT (and Design)) have been published and are currently awaiting registration by the United States Patent and Trademark Office.",
